          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কষ্ট (kôshṭô) is a tatsama, Sanskrit kaṣṭa, \"bad, ill, painful\" (Monier-Williams); Bengali uses it as a noun, the hardship itself."
            }
